      "updated": 1778052670993,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": ">\"https://inspired-quail-partly.ngrok-free.app/get_pronoun_gender\"\nColab API call is made.\n\n>generative_coref_prediction.ipynb file of colab performs\ngender prediction and returns the data to\npronoun_based_generative.py file , this data is returned to \nensemble_gender.py file , this is returned to main.py and finally \nreturned back to server.py inside get_gender_info().  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": ">\"https://inspired-quail-partly.ngrok-free.app/get_pronoun_gender\"\nColab API call is made.\n\n>generative_coref_prediction.ipynb file of colab performs\ngender prediction and returns the data to\npronoun_based_generative.py file , this data is returned to \nensemble_gender.py file , this is returned to main.py and finally \nreturned back to server.py inside get_gender_info().  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
